**/android/.gradle/
**/android/build/
**/android/app/build/
**/android/.cxx/
**/android/app/.cxx/

# iOS generated files
**/ios/build/
**/ios/Pods/
**/DerivedData/

# Generated output
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/web-build/

# Build files
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.ipa

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Editor and OS files
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db